?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twTU5FRkJlalUzUldnM2FtRnpaWFJaT0Y5WlgwRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twTU5FRkJlalUzUldnM2FtRnpaWFJaT0Y5WlgwRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twTU5FRkJlalUzUldnM2FtRnpaWFJaT0Y5WlgwRRILMGRwRHR0MmEwNHgaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rcE1ORUZCZWpVM1JXZzNhbUZ6WlhSWk9GOVpYMEUSCzBkcER0dDJhMDR4IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARclLKSvzeKscqCzBkcER0dDJhMDR4\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjDta3T9dSWAxWRrlYBHVfLDLYQoykIXygJ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwj36bHT9dSWAxUhgNYIHTDJAdMQ0pMFCCIoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjDta3T9dSWAxWRrlYBHVfLDLYQ0pMFCFAoAQ"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aM1QzbFJhVmhLTTFVMk1IUkVWblJFUzBoaVlsRRAB",["0x0:0xc72adefc4aca5272",null,1782721914118725,1782721914118725,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108662072944284647317/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["陳小靜","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsp6QBr9sMXTT-7nAKLxGy2K0DIrbQcn1SkdnOS9d-Sx5yf9_x\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108662072944284647317?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"108662072944284647317",null,7,4,null,[0,3,1],4,["7 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjDta3T9dSWAxWRrlYBHVfLDLYQpr8GCGEoAA"]]]],null,"2 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[1],null,null,null,null,null,[[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjDta3T9dSWAxWRrlYBHVfLDLYQ3IcHCGIoAQ",null,null,null,[1],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["第一次遇到因免費飲料灑出幾滴在地上，就被收取清潔費的店家，這次消費真的令人失望。\n\n當天使用店內免費飲料機，店家提供的是白色不透明茶杯，我按的是芭樂多多，因飲料顏色與杯子顏色非常接近，加上杯子位置離出水口很近，觀察了一會仍看不出是否有正常出水，以為飲料機沒有作動，所以又按了一次，結果導致飲料溢出，只有少量滴落地面。\n\n擔心造成其他顧客滑倒，主動向店員告知，希望店家能協助處理。沒想到回應卻是：「沒關係，反正我們要收清潔費。」\n\n讓我無法接受的不是收費本身，而是：\n1.店家使用不透明杯具，確實容易讓消費者無法判斷飲料是否已流出，現場也看到其他顧客在飲料機前停留許久，顯然不是只有我遇到這個問題。\n\n2.面對誠實主動告知的顧客，第一句話就是表示要收清潔費，服務態度令人感受不佳。\n\n3.清潔費金額約占一碗麵價格三成，對於只是少量飲料滴落地面的情況，我認為有失比例。\n\n4.結帳時只提供發票，沒有主動提供明細，直到我要求才拿出來。而明細上也沒有寫「清潔費」，竟然是以「其他加點」列示，讓人對收費透明度產生疑問。\n\n希望店家能改善飲料區設計、服務態度及收費透明度，避免其他消費者有相同經驗。",null,[0,40]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17816234541938367285/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhTTFRemJGSmhWbWhMVFRGVk1rMUlVa1ZXYmxKRlV6Qm9hVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17816234541938367285/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhTTFRemJGSmhWbWhMVFRGVk1rMUlVa1ZXYmxKRlV6Qm9hVmxzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17816234541938367285/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhTTFRemJGSmhWbWhMVFRGVk1rMUlVa1ZXYmxKRlV6Qm9hVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17816234541938367285/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhTTFRemJGSmhWbWhMVFRGVk1rMUlVa1ZXYmxKRlV6Qm9hVmxzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17816234541938367285/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhTTFRemJGSmhWbWhMVFRGVk1rMUlVa1ZXYmxKRlV6Qm9hVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17816234541938367285/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhTTFRemJGSmhWbWhMVFRGVk1rMUlVa1ZXYmxKRlV6Qm9hVmxzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,506,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aM1QzbFJhVmhLTTFVMk1IUkVWblJFUzBoaVlsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xc72adefc4aca5272!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmZ3T3lRaVhKM1U2MHREVnRES0hiYlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aM1QzbFJhVmhLTTFVMk1IUkVWblJFUzBoaVlsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aM1QzbFJhVmhLTTFVMk1IUkVWblJFUzBoaVlsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aM1QzbFJhVmhLTTFVMk1IUkVWblJFUzBoaVlsRRILMGVGWHB1NjN0Y3UaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tWjNUM2xSYVZoS00xVTJNSFJFVm5SRVMwaGlZbEUSCzBlRlhwdTYzdGN1Ih